then the Governor and everyone getting split

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:37.510
up. I think that just means that in the first
couple of episodes we'll meet the new Terminus

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:44.510
characters as well as the non-Terminus Father
Gabriel character played by Seth Gilliam.

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:50.050
The first big wrinkle in the plot at Terminus
