twist at the mid season finale last year.

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:09.000
This year I think it's going to be the Survivors
escaping Terminus.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.530
It's totally possible they could keep them
there all season, but regardless of when they

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:17.340
